@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### JSON body + path 参数：登录成功
POST {{base}}/tenants/1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "demo",
  "password": "password"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.token);
%}

### JSON 校验失败：password 太短，返回 application/json
POST {{base}}/tenants/1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "demo",
  "password": "bad"
}

### 不支持的 Content-Type：解码阶段返回 415
POST {{base}}/tenants/1/login
Content-Type: text/plain

hello

### application/x-www-form-urlencoded 表单绑定
POST {{base}}/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&account=demo&password=password

### form 表单跨字段校验失败
POST {{base}}/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&account=demo

### 强类型响应外壳：status/header/Set-Cookie/body
POST {{base}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "demo",
  "password": "password"
}

### 嵌套 JSON 请求体：profile 来自 body，UserID 来自 header
PATCH {{base}}/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-User-ID: user-1

{
  "profile": {
    "display_name": "Demo User",
    "bio": "I like typed HTTP handlers."
  }
}

### path + header + JSON body：创建报表
POST {{base}}/tenants/1/reports
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Version: demo-client/1.0

{
  "name": "Monthly report",
  "format": "csv"
}

### query slice：重复 tag 参数会绑定到 []string
GET {{base}}/reports/search?status=queued&tag=finance&tag=monthly&page=1

### 自定义字段校验 + 请求级校验
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_user",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "password",
  "confirm_password": "password"
}

### JWT 中间件 + Accept 内容协商
GET {{base}}/profile?page=1&verbose=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/vnd.ohmyhttp.demo+json

### Accept 不支持：返回 406
GET {{base}}/profile?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/xml

### Handler 返回业务错误：映射成 403
GET {{base}}/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 登录管理员账号并保存管理员 JWT
POST {{base}}/tenants/1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "admin",
  "password": "password"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token);
%}

### 管理员 JWT 通过角色检查
GET {{base}}/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 手动 ohmyhttp.Response + WithHeader
GET {{base}}/reports/monthly/metadata

### StackError：客户端收到通用 500，服务端日志包含错误产生位置的堆栈
GET {{base}}/reports/failure/metadata

### 业务错误：公开 code/message/details，返回 409
GET {{base}}/errors/business

### StackError：客户端只收到通用 500，服务端日志包含错误产生位置的堆栈
GET {{base}}/errors/stack

### 普通未知错误：客户端收到通用 500，但错误本身不包含调用堆栈
GET {{base}}/errors/unknown

### PanicError：Recovery 返回通用 500，服务端日志包含 panic 堆栈
GET {{base}}/errors/panic

### http.ErrAbortHandler：立即关闭连接，不返回 HTTP 响应，客户端会看到 EOF
GET {{base}}/errors/abort

### 文件下载
GET {{base}}/reports/monthly/download

### 重定向
GET {{base}}/reports/monthly/redirect

### 流式 CSV
GET {{base}}/reports/monthly/export?rows=3

### SSE
GET {{base}}/events?count=3

### 204 No Content
DELETE {{base}}/reports/monthly

### 静态目录浏览：返回由 staticDirectoryResponse 生成的 HTML 列表
GET {{base}}/browse/

### 领域错误：报表不存在，映射成 404 JSON 错误
GET {{base}}/reports/missing/download

### 底层框架原生 404，不进入 ohmyhttp 端点中间件
GET {{base}}/not-found
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### OpenAPI JSON
GET {{base}}/openapi.json

### OpenAPI schemas
GET {{base}}/schemas

### 单个 schema
GET {{base}}/schemas?name=DemoUpdateProfileBody

